From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: git push: make sign-on-push accept a revset

Intersect the configured signing selector with outgoing commits and force-sign
the mutable matches. Warn about immutable matches that cannot be rewritten

Default to none() and migrate boolean values for six releases so existing
configurations keep their old mutable, unsigned, own-commit behavior
---
